{"ticker":{"symbol":"000105.KS","name":"유한양행우","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":67400.0,"change_pct":-0.001481481481481528,"market_cap":4961703821312.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.009050445103857567,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":113300.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":2082,"website":"https://www.yuhan.co.kr","business_summary":"Yuhan Corporation operates as a pharmaceutical company in South Korea and internationally. It offers manufacturing services, such as custom manufacturing; process research and development of active pharmaceutical products (APIs) and intermediates; kilo and pilot-scale production of APIs and intermediates; commercial production of APIs and intermediates; production of chemical specialties; and analytical method development and regulatory support. The company also provides APIs and intermediates, including antibiotic, anti-thrombotic, anti-hyperlipidemics, and anti-hypertensive; and custom synthesis services through commercial supply in areas of anti-viral, anti-HIV, anti-HCV, anti-biotic, antihistamine, anti-diabetic, ß-lactamase inhibitor, CNS intermediate, PEG-compounds, and others. Yuhan Corporation was founded in 1926 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"유한양행은 한국과 해외에서 제약회사로 활동하고 있습니다. 맞춤형 제조와 같은 제조 서비스를 제공합니다. 활성 의약품(API) 및 중간체의 공정 연구 및 개발; API 및 중간체의 킬로 규모 및 파일럿 규모 생산; API 및 중간체의 상업적 생산; 화학 특산품 생산; 분석 방법 개발 및 규제 지원. 이 회사는 또한 항생제, 항혈전제, 항고지혈증제, 항고혈압제를 포함한 API 및 중간체를 제공합니다. 항바이러스제, 항HIV제, 항HCV제, 항생제, 항히스타민제, 항당뇨병제, β-락타마제 억제제, CNS 중간체, PEG 화합물 등의 분야에 상업적 공급을 통한 맞춤형 합성 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 유한양행은 1926년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":2355092490000.0,"rev_lo":2311655260000.0,"rev_hi":2455800000000.0,"rev_g":0.1185,"n":15},{"period":"2027","rev":2548533850000.0,"rev_lo":2443000000000.0,"rev_hi":2780300000000.0,"rev_g":0.1254,"n":17}],"ltg":null